{
  "category": "Pig Monkey Pokémon",
  "entries": [
    {
      "text": "Extremely quick to anger. It could be docile one moment then thrashing away the next instant.",
      "version": "red"
    },
    {
      "text": "Extremely quick to anger. It could be docile one moment then thrashing away the next instant.",
      "version": "blue"
    },
    {
      "text": "An agile POKéMON that lives in trees. It angers easily and will not hesitate to attack anything.",
      "version": "yellow"
    },
    {
      "text": "It is extremely ill-tempered. Groups of them will attack any handy target for no reason.",
      "version": "gold"
    },
    {
      "text": "It's unsafe to approach if it gets violently enraged for no reason and can't distinguish friends from foes.",
      "version": "silver"
    },
    {
      "text": "It lives in groups in the treetops. If it loses sight of its group, it becomes infuriated by its loneliness.",
      "version": "crystal"
    },
    {
      "text": "When MANKEY starts shaking and its nasal breathing turns rough, it’s a sure sign that it is becoming angry. However, because it goes into a towering rage almost instantly, it is impossible for anyone to flee its wrath.",
      "version": "ruby"
    },
    {
      "text": "When MANKEY starts shaking and its nasal breathing turns rough, it’s a sure sign that it is becoming angry. However, because it goes into a towering rage almost instantly, it is impossible for anyone to flee its wrath.",
      "version": "sapphire"
    },
    {
      "text": "When it starts shaking and its nasal breathing turns rough, it’s a sure sign of anger. However, since this happens instantly, there is no time to flee.",
      "version": "emerald"
    },
    {
      "text": "Light and agile on its feet, and ferocious in temperament. When angered, it flies into an uncontrollable frenzy.",
      "version": "firered"
    },
    {
      "text": "Extremely quick to anger. It could be docile one moment, then thrashing away the next instant.",
      "version": "leafgreen"
    },
    {
      "text": "It lives in treetop colonies. If one becomes enraged, the whole colony rampages for no reason.",
      "version": "diamond"
